<figure class="context-architecture-figure not-prose my-8 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] px-4 py-5 sm:px-6 sm:py-6">
  <header class="mb-5 sm:mb-6">
    <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-lg">Where do these concerns live in the architecture?</h3>
    <p class="mt-1 max-w-2xl text-xs leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)] sm:text-sm sm:leading-6">Implemented behavior, current state, and structure already have clear homes. The proposition is to give meaning and composition equally explicit ownership.</p>
  </header>

  <section aria-label="Established architectural homes">
    <p class="mb-2 font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Established architectural homes</p>
    <div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--border-subtle)] md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-4">
        <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Implemented behavior</p>
        <h4 class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Code</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Mechanics, side effects, algorithms, and what the system does now.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-4">
        <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Current state</p>
        <h4 class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Data</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">The authoritative current facts the application knows.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-4">
        <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Structure</p>
        <h4 class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Schemas</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Contracts for valid shapes, fields, relationships, and interfaces.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-5" aria-label="Research proposition">
    <p class="mb-2 font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--accent)]">Research proposition</p>
    <div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-[var(--accent-border)] bg-[var(--accent-border)] md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] p-4">
        <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Meaning and intent</p>
        <h4 class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Product knowledge</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Purpose, relevance, explanation, prerequisites, and policy rationale.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] p-4">
        <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Composition</p>
        <h4 class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Context + policy + capabilities</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Which trusted capabilities matter now and how they may be assembled.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-primary)]" aria-label="Durable, selectable, applicable, composable">
    <span>Durable</span><span class="text-[var(--accent)]" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <span>Selectable</span><span class="text-[var(--accent)]" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <span>Applicable</span><span class="text-[var(--accent)]" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <span>Composable</span>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="mt-6 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] pt-4 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-muted)] sm:text-xs sm:leading-6">
    The proposal is additive. Product knowledge does not replace code, application state, schemas, tests, governing specifications, or deterministic enforcement. Authority remains scoped to the concern each artifact owns.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

